                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump\u2019s answer to our youth mental health crisis?\n\nTake away funding that provided our children with the mental health support they needed. We need more access to mental health resources, not less. It\u2019s a proven way to help prevent suicides, violence and addiction.",
