                "quoted_status_profile_username": "AmandaSeitz",
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Donald Trump just gave deportation agents access to Medicaid data \u2014 even after Medicaid officials warned it was legally and ethically wrong. This is the personal health info of people in California. \n\nWe should never use a person\u2019s need to go to the doctor against them. This will only lead to more chaos and pain in our communities.",
