                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The sun is coming up \u2014 but it\u2019s a very dark day in America.\n\nAfter hours of backroom deals and arm-twisting, Republicans are about to pass a budget nobody wants except the billionaires and large corporations who will get even more tax breaks, while millions lose health coverage, food benefits, and daycare.",
