                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "We have a youth mental health crisis, and not nearly enough psychologists and mental health professionals to help our young students.  \n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m proud to announce that I\u2019m co-leading the Preparing for the Future Act with @RepJoshG This bill will address the shortage of mental health professionals by providing scholarships for student psychologists who serve at schools.",
