                "source": "Vista Social",
                "text": "The Trump admin froze HIV prevention investments, cutting off lifesaving care across South LA. I led the fight to get this funding restored because science \u2014 not political spite \u2014 should drive public health. Glad the CDC reversed course and thankful for of the allies that stood with us and the LGBTQ community.  \nhttps://t.co/8t9zsVMGZU",
