                "text": "The Trump administration illegally withheld Head Start funding \u2014 blocking critical support for children in need. While they play politics with kids' futures, we won\u2019t stop fighting to expand access to early learning, health care, and nutrition because every child deserves a strong start.\n\nThe Trump administration must release these congressionally mandated investments now.\nhttps://t.co/SOAIsoYH1y",
